                        "form": "наёмниках"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b31609d4-fc02-3117-9952-6efaf6f6fb75",
                        "entry_id": "3bc8f328-75ff-37d1-b38c-923f94ca230b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "военнослужащий наёмного войска, наёмной армии"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9530000-a92b-3222-8356-578982d93d6e",
                        "entry_id": "3bc8f328-75ff-37d1-b38c-923f94ca230b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. тот, кто защищает чужие интересы из корыстных побуждений"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3f80eaf8-b69f-3cd0-ac1e-be8f93e464e7",
                        "entry_id": "3bc8f328-75ff-37d1-b38c-923f94ca230b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. наёмный рабочий, работник"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "fe7f7317-6efe-45e0-985d-e6c8377c0923",
                                "sense_id": "3f80eaf8-b69f-3cd0-ac1e-be8f93e464e7",
                                "text": "А наемник, не пастырь, которому овцы не свои, видит приходящего волка, и оставляет овец, и бежит; и волк расхищает овец и разгоняет их."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4e4e2e87-a519-34fe-b7c3-9d57d6a5c2d9",
                        "entry_id": "3bc8f328-75ff-37d1-b38c-923f94ca230b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "истор. помещик-арендатор, приобретавший за плату во временное владение имение с крепостными крестьянами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "23ad41d4-e208-4158-b099-b10e1a558437",
                                "sense_id": "4e4e2e87-a519-34fe-b7c3-9d57d6a5c2d9",
                                "text": "Ныне ещё поверье заводится отдавать деревни, как то называется, на аренду. А мы называем это отдавать головой. Голый наёмник дерёт с мужиков кожу; даже лучшей поры нам не оставляет."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "84e8dc2d-8a71-48d9-b487-181b482f60a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "3bc8f328-75ff-37d1-b38c-923f94ca230b",
                        "source_sense_description": "военнослужащий наёмного войска, наёмной армии",
                        "target_lang_word": "mercenary",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mercenary",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c750d0eb-50f2-380b-8283-0d3d6c7076b8",
                                        "entry_id": "edc8bb50-726f-3243-822c-cf70aeaad474",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One motivated by gain, especially monetary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32554ce0-dc7c-4194-9236-d84c6462147c",
                                                "sense_id": "c750d0eb-50f2-380b-8283-0d3d6c7076b8",
                                                "text": "J. Argyrofylus, a mercenary Greek, who came to teach school in Italy, after the sacking of Constantinople by the Turks, used to maintain that Cicero understood neither Philosophy nor Greek"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1025d38-a316-4bd0-8f3e-73d1f6702f8c",
                                                "sense_id": "c750d0eb-50f2-380b-8283-0d3d6c7076b8",
                                                "text": "Such a man emphatically deserves the name of fortune-hunter—a wretch as detestable in society, as destructive of domestic happiness! And if, when marriages are consummated on such plans, there be afterwards between the parties the least appearance of regard, and the common forms of decorum, it is more than can reasonably be expected, and infinitely more than such mercenaries deserve."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "557ef6a2-b17d-42dc-b824-babeab8c0bb8",
                                                "sense_id": "c750d0eb-50f2-380b-8283-0d3d6c7076b8",
                                                "text": "HOSPITAL NUNS./ Louis XVI. wishing to improve the state of the hospitals in France, sent a member of the Academy of Sciences to England, to enquire into the manner in which such establishments were conducted there. The commissioner praised them; but remarked, that two things were wanting; the zeal of the French parochial clergy, and the charity of the hospital nuns. \"We have found, by sorrowful experience,\" said M. Portalis, that mercenaries, without any motive of feeling to attach them constantly to their duty, can never supply the place of persons animated by a spirit of religion,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86905d7c-a7ba-48ca-b10a-59be78dd565c",
                                                "sense_id": "c750d0eb-50f2-380b-8283-0d3d6c7076b8",
                                                "text": "In the higher ranks of life especially, it is, unhappily, a very common practice to commit to hired mercenaries, that important duty which nature at once commands and enables the mother to perform; that of suckling her infant."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d547348-0d1b-48d5-b452-f1ea2c752e64",
                                                "sense_id": "c750d0eb-50f2-380b-8283-0d3d6c7076b8",
                                                "text": "For that is the characteristic of a mercenary, who acts through interest, rather than of an affectionate child who acts through love. There is a great difference, say they, between the service of a slave, the service of a mercenary or hireling, and the service of a child."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7b658a2a-cca5-3b1b-b1bc-ecd6d26ad1d5",
                                        "entry_id": "edc8bb50-726f-3243-822c-cf70aeaad474",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person employed to fight in an armed conflict who is not a member of the state or military group for which they are fighting and whose primary motivation is private gain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1097cdf6-95cc-4277-b62c-39f93399ba04",
                                                "sense_id": "7b658a2a-cca5-3b1b-b1bc-ecd6d26ad1d5",
                                                "text": "He exhorts the emperor to revive the courage of his subjects by the example of manly virtue; to banish luxury from the court and from the camp; to substitute in the place of the Barbarian mercenaries, an army of men interested in the defence of their laws and of their property"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2b0bfbd-c3b6-49aa-b635-984b3b2e0e74",
                                                "sense_id": "7b658a2a-cca5-3b1b-b1bc-ecd6d26ad1d5",
                                                "text": "If a mercenary died, that was one fewer man to pay. Mercenaries were an efficient way to run a military campaign especially in view of the employer's ability to hire and fire when and if the situation demanded"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c92c0398-cdc4-4e9d-9389-05d55b0ba94a",
                                                "sense_id": "7b658a2a-cca5-3b1b-b1bc-ecd6d26ad1d5",
                                                "text": "The combat fatigues worn by the vehicle personnel did not appear to be standard military issue, more similar to what you would expect mercenaries to wear. Mercenaries, loyal to nothing except themselves and their off-shore bank accounts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa29135f-85cc-3c2f-9b29-a0aba8a73cea",
                                        "entry_id": "edc8bb50-726f-3243-822c-cf70aeaad474",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One hired to engage in a figurative battle, as a corporate takeover, a lawsuit, or a political campaign."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mercenary",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8e1c7e50-0f1a-3bc2-9acb-db043dc10e2e",
                                        "entry_id": "c8949a32-da09-32f3-9931-f13c068039f9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Motivated by personal gain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3067903f-2777-443f-a99e-b9d00a526217",
                                                "sense_id": "8e1c7e50-0f1a-3bc2-9acb-db043dc10e2e",
                                                "text": "Success is never so interesting as struggle—not even to the successful, not even to the most mercenary forms of ambition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eedd3f5c-817c-4cad-bf59-df594ce43282",
                        "source_entry_id": "3bc8f328-75ff-37d1-b38c-923f94ca230b",
                        "source_sense_description": "военнослужащий наёмного войска, наёмной армии",
                        "target_lang_word": "mercenaire",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mercenaire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "71ee93cf-d8bd-3f22-81cc-acbc7fdfe7c3",
                                        "entry_id": "61d2d25e-9bff-30b6-8f91-7400d7d8dc99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dont on trouve commode d’acheter le service, ou l’usage pour une période limitée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8fa82f5f-98cd-48f5-b407-c2a7fa95a5b9",
                                                "sense_id": "71ee93cf-d8bd-3f22-81cc-acbc7fdfe7c3",
                                                "text": "Je ne souffrirais jamais que des soins mercenaires, qu’une femme ou une fille étrangère s’initiassent (femme littéraire !) aux secrets de ma chambre."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ef35c4d-4c15-4adc-9ad5-9f8af28d5176",
                                                "sense_id": "71ee93cf-d8bd-3f22-81cc-acbc7fdfe7c3",
                                                "text": "Il est des individus nés mercenaires qui ne font aucun bien à leurs amis ou à leurs proches, parce qu’ils le doivent ; tandis qu’en rendant service à des inconnus, ils en recueillent un gain d’amour-propre : plus le cercle de leurs affections est près d’eux, moins ils aiment ; plus il s’étend, plus serviables ils sont."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b2beb8a-ebb4-4799-982a-6356aba72094",
                                                "sense_id": "71ee93cf-d8bd-3f22-81cc-acbc7fdfe7c3",
                                                "text": "Lola, il faut le dire, n’avait jamais confectionné de beignets de sa vie. Elle embaucha donc un certain nombre de cuisinières mercenaires, et les beignets furent, après quelques essais, prêts à être livrés ponctuellement juteux, dorés et sucrés à ravir. Lola n’avait plus en somme qu’à les goûter avant qu’on les expédiât dans les divers services hospitaliers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ca714c3-8c9c-4e49-9fbc-5658c4091c87",
                                                "sense_id": "71ee93cf-d8bd-3f22-81cc-acbc7fdfe7c3",
                                                "text": "Pour qualifier une chose: Qu’a-t-il été faire, un soir, […], en ce bouge à marins ? […] Quelle démission de sa fierté a pu le conduire en cette rue infâme, le jeter dans un lit mercenaire ? La fille avachie, hâtive, soucieuse d’autre clients."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f34f08a0-3ca6-3f30-918e-8a9c515d6d1f",
                                        "entry_id": "61d2d25e-9bff-30b6-8f91-7400d7d8dc99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie les troupes le plus souvent étrangères dont on se sert pour faire la guerre."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "da4d60b7-9fe4-4a94-bac2-90d753aaf640",
                                                "sense_id": "f34f08a0-3ca6-3f30-918e-8a9c515d6d1f",
                                                "text": "des bataillons, des compagnies mercenaires."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2c2279c4-5588-3d6a-bf3e-e3d242f76524",
                                        "entry_id": "61d2d25e-9bff-30b6-8f91-7400d7d8dc99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui se laisse corrompre du fait de sa cupidité, et à qui on peut faire faire tout ce qu’on veut, en payant ce qu'il faut."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c4a64082-3352-4d67-9f38-d73c50f824dd",
                                                "sense_id": "2c2279c4-5588-3d6a-bf3e-e3d242f76524",
                                                "text": "C’est une âme, un talent, un esprit mercenaire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e399118-89c8-451f-bc86-b07017a4fada",
                                                "sense_id": "2c2279c4-5588-3d6a-bf3e-e3d242f76524",
                                                "text": "Une éloquence mercenaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad054b0a-4bf2-38a1-91ec-fa4111ec7839",
                                        "entry_id": "61d2d25e-9bff-30b6-8f91-7400d7d8dc99",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui n’agit que pour un salaire, qui est inspiré par le profit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "pejorative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mercenaire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dc989486-fe6c-3989-b71b-b07d2d279ac2",
                                        "entry_id": "ddab393f-453e-3e5c-a82b-4da1671f8f97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ouvrier, un artisan, un homme de journée, intérimaire qui travaille pour gagner sa vie, sans contrat de longue durée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70db4c3a-5e0b-445a-962b-9efd855fca90",
                                                "sense_id": "dc989486-fe6c-3989-b71b-b07d2d279ac2",
                                                "text": "Travailler comme un mercenaire, travailler beaucoup."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5bf3d4b-1fef-4ae2-92b2-59c8d8237bef",
                                                "sense_id": "dc989486-fe6c-3989-b71b-b07d2d279ac2",
                                                "text": "Employer des mercenaires pour finir le travail à temps et honorer la commande."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e1b42118-aff3-3179-81f8-889d3c06ebdb",
                                        "entry_id": "ddab393f-453e-3e5c-a82b-4da1671f8f97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Médecin intérimaire en milieu hospitalier."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "especially"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b212eb08-2e11-43a1-8678-063090f8805c",
                                                "sense_id": "e1b42118-aff3-3179-81f8-889d3c06ebdb",
                                                "text": "Une surenchère à laquelle le ministre de la santé, François Braun, entend mettre un terme : « Je ne suis pas opposé à l’intérim en général, mais aux pratiques de certains mercenaires multirécidivistes, qui se vendent au plus offrant »."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "efe7e45d-eb38-379c-9b22-902f11ee30ab",
                                        "entry_id": "ddab393f-453e-3e5c-a82b-4da1671f8f97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Étranger qui s'engage dans une armée de métier par intérêt pécuniaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7827a345-4cf0-4bf1-a8ae-6eb6939ff322",
                                                "sense_id": "efe7e45d-eb38-379c-9b22-902f11ee30ab",
                                                "text": "Fiers d’avoir fait plier la République, les Mercenaires croyaient qu’ils allaient enfin s’en retourner chez eux, avec la solde de leur sang dans le capuchon de leur manteau."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c58f2fd6-0ea2-466e-a9de-5cd0478cc793",
                                                "sense_id": "efe7e45d-eb38-379c-9b22-902f11ee30ab",
                                                "text": "Le lendemain, il prend le château de Damville, à vingt kilomètres de Verneuil, et regagne ensuite Rouen, d’où il envoie aussitôt ses mercenaires en Bretagne, vers Fougères et Dol."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19ee30cc-c1ce-4b11-8f6f-22f0680e926d",
                                                "sense_id": "efe7e45d-eb38-379c-9b22-902f11ee30ab",
                                                "text": "Il est primordial de faire la distinction entre un mercenaire et un combattant étranger, car ces deux statuts ne donnent pas droit aux mêmes protections juridiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c8154da3-9158-32d4-8c14-ec209a917610",
                                        "entry_id": "ddab393f-453e-3e5c-a82b-4da1671f8f97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne intéressée, facile à employer si on y met le prix."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97d71397-76d6-4aaf-808c-e774e3163156",
                                                "sense_id": "c8154da3-9158-32d4-8c14-ec209a917610",
                                                "text": "Des millions de $ sont ainsi versés par la USAID ou la NED à des mercenaires cubains (définition de ce mot : personnes qui, en échange d’argent, combattent pour une puissance étrangère) pour les encourager à susciter des actes de provocation un peu partout sur l’île et à les publiciser au maximum, de façon à …."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea6646ca-b1fa-485c-9d95-924dc19d2e04",
                                                "sense_id": "c8154da3-9158-32d4-8c14-ec209a917610",
                                                "text": "C’est un mercenaire sans honneur, un vil mercenaire à la solde de qui vous savez."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "445445b8-3f04-36fe-a778-7e0848d190e5",
                                        "entry_id": "ddab393f-453e-3e5c-a82b-4da1671f8f97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui n’agit que pour un salaire et qui est inspirée par le profit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
